      <div class="article__main">
        <div class="article__body prose">
          <blockquote>
<ul>
<li><strong>Quick answer:</strong> GTA 6 unlocks at <strong>12:00 AM (midnight) on Thursday 19 November 2026 in your own time zone</strong>, on PS5 and Xbox Series X|S.</li>
<li><strong>Europe (CET, incl. Slovenia):</strong> 00:00 CET on Thu 19 Nov. <strong>UK:</strong> 00:00 GMT. <strong>US East:</strong> 12:00 AM ET (= 06:00 CET). <strong>New Zealand goes first:</strong> 12:00 CET today (Wed 18 Nov).</li>
<li><strong>US warning:</strong> consoles show <strong>one US moment (midnight ET = 9:00 PM Pacific)</strong>, so check your own countdown. Pre-loading does not unlock the game early.</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>Words used on this page.</strong> A <em>rolling launch</em> means the game unlocks at midnight in each time zone, one after another, not all at once. <em>Pre-load</em> means downloading the game early so it is ready when it unlocks. <em>CET</em> is central European time, the time in Slovenia, Germany and Italy.</p>
<p><strong>Europe tonight:</strong> in central Europe (CET: Germany, Austria, Italy, France, Slovenia and more) GTA VI unlocks at <strong>00:00 CET on Thursday 19 November</strong>, which is 23:00 UTC on Wednesday 18 November. It is <em>not</em> 06:00 CET: 06:00 CET is the moment of the US (Eastern) unlock. Slovenia and Croatia are not listed by name in the sources we found, but both sit in CET and the German, Austrian and Italian store listings show 00:00 CET. Check the countdown on your own console.</p>
<p><strong>First unlock in the world:</strong> New Zealand, at 12:00 CET on Wednesday 18 November (today).</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Heads-up for US players:</strong> GamesRadar and PC Gamer both saw US PlayStation unlock screens set to <strong>one Eastern Time moment: midnight ET = 9:00 PM Pacific on Wednesday 18 November</strong>, not a separate midnight for each US time zone. Rockstar’s wording says “midnight local time”. Check the countdown on your own console.</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="gta-6-unlock-time-by-time-zone" tabindex="-1">GTA 6 unlock time by time zone</h2>
<p>All times are for the night of <strong>18 → 19 November 2026</strong>. “Unlock (local)” is what your clock should show when the game goes live. “In CET” is the same moment in central European time (CET = UTC+1, the time in Slovenia, Germany, Italy and more). The table is in <strong>unlock order</strong>, earliest first.</p>
<p><strong>Status key:</strong> ✅ listed in regional store data and consistent with Rockstar’s “midnight local” wording · ⚠️ our arithmetic from “midnight local”, not listed by name · 🔶 sources conflict (see below)</p>
