<h2 id="is-the-unlock-midnight-local-or-global" tabindex="-1">Is the unlock midnight-local or global?</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Midnight local, region by region.</strong> Rockstar’s support article, as quoted by PlanetGTA6, says the game releases “midnight local time on November 19, 2026, in all regions” on both PS5 and Xbox Series X|S. PlayStation’s own support page says the same. Sony also described a “rolling midnight launch by country, beginning at 12:00AM NZDT in New Zealand.”</li>
<li><strong>US exception in practice.</strong> GamesRadar and PC Gamer report that US PlayStation unlock screens use midnight Eastern for everyone in the US. PC Gamer notes the same may be true on Xbox, but that is not confirmed. Rockstar’s wording remains “midnight local time” (see the conflict table below).</li>
<li><strong>Xbox store note.</strong> GamesRadar reports Xbox runs a single global store, so time-zone tricks may behave differently there. Rockstar has not said anything about such tricks. We don’t recommend them: changing your region or buying through a second account means you cannot move save data back to your main account (Push Square) and may break platform terms.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="when-sources-disagree" tabindex="-1">When sources disagree</h2>
